---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Services
permalink: /services/
---
<div class="hero">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <h1>Services</h1>
    <p>
      Comprehensive Community Support Services (CCSS) and Peer Support Services (PSS)
      are available to Medicaid recipients. Services help clients develop skills and
      connect to resources related to independent and community living, learning,
      employment, socialization, and recreation.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="services-grid wrapper">
  {% for service in services.list %}
  <div class="service-card">
    {% if service.icon %}
      <img src="{{ service.icon }}" alt="" class="service-card__icon">
    {% else %}
      <span class="service-card__badge">{{ service.title | serviceIcon }}</span>
    {% endif %}
    <h3>{{ service.title }}</h3>
    <p>{{ service.description | safe }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

{% include "components/crisis-callout.njk" %}
